liest fighter of The Three; capable of compassion toward allies.', 'His brothers; Residents of Dweomer City; Any who fight his enemies', 'Grim Reapers; Lord Alistair Dunscon; Coalition States; the Undead; Necromancers; Witches', 'Combat-focused member of The Three, styled the Avenger; Dweomer''s chief enforcer and deadliest fighter.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.26-27');
  'leizak-dzir', 'Leizak D''zir', NULL, 'High Lord Creator', 'rifts', 'Unknown; supernatural on a god-like level', '15th level High Magus, 12th level Stone Master, 9th level Temporal Wizard', 15, 'Unprincipled', 'Thousands if not millions of years old', '17 feet (5.2 m) tall', '1.7 tons', '{"IQ":26,"ME":28,"MA":20,"PS":40,"PP":24,"PE":28,"PB":10,"Spd":20}', NULL, NULL, 12000, 7400, NULL, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":6,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":4,"roll":4}', 'critical hit natural 19-20; +8 to save vs Horror Factor; 7 physical or 3 spell attacks/melee; teleport self 98%, dimensional teleport 96%', '[{"name":"Communication skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Science skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Mechanical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Technical skills (all)","pct":80},{"name":"Electrical skills (all)","pct":80},{"name":"Rogue skills (all)","pct":80},{"name":"Pilot boats/ships","pct":90},{"name":"Horsemanship: Knight","pct":90},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Faeriespeak","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Elven/Dragonese","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Demongogian","pct":98}]', 'Pilot-related skills at 90%; W.P. sword, W.P. knife, W.P. revolver, W.P. energy pistol all at 14th level; literate in all languages he speaks at 98%', 'Feeds on ley line magic, no need to eat/drink; fast bio-regen; invisibility at will; keen hawk-like sight; immune to S.D.C. weapons; resists heat/cold; teleports.', 'All spells levels 8-15; All creation, transformation and illusion spells; All stone magic; All Temporal Magic; Spell Strength 17', NULL, 'Epic Scale (optional); God-like perceptions (optional); Deific Power: Create Deific Portal; Deific Power: Forge Holy Weapon; Deific Power: Weaponwright; Deific Power: Transmutation', NULL, 'Access to rare Techno-Wizard and magical devices (will not use rune weapons, Bio-Wizard creations, or anything linked to Necromancy/Undead)', NULL, 'Quiet, analytical and patient; most cerebral, least battle-oriented of the three; a devoted teacher.', 'His brothers; Residents of Dweomer City; Federation of Magic factions who accept him', 'Grim Reapers; Lord Alistair Dunscon; Coalition States; the Undead; Necromancers; Witches', 'Most scholarly of The Three; mentors Dweomer''s High Magi and safeguards the city''s magical concealment and defenses.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.27');
  'alistair-dunscon', 'Alistair Dunscon', 'Alistair Winston Dunscon', 'Lord Dunscon, "the Mad"', 'rifts', 'Once human, now immortal (quasi-supernatural)', '10th level Ley Line Walker and 8th level Shifter', 10, 'Diabolic', '105 (appears to be in his 30s)', '5 feet, 11 inches tall (1.75 m)', '150 lbs. (67.5 kg)', '{"IQ":28,"ME":13,"MA":17,"PS":11,"PP":20,"PE":17,"PB":16,"Spd":14}', NULL, NULL, 58, 1458, NULL, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":4,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'Critical strike on 19-20; body flip/throw; +3 to save vs psionic attack; +1 to save vs magic; had 79 H.P./36 S.D.C. before becoming immortal (now a 58 M.D.C. creature)', '[{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Demongogian","pct":90},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Gobblely","pct":98}]', 'All Ley Line Walker O.C.C. skills at 98%, all Shifter O.C.C. skills at 90%; all lore, history, science and computer skills (incl. hacking); read sensory equipment, basic electronics/mechanics, pilot hover vehicle/cycle, horsemanship (general), all communication skills at 90%; W.P. staff & W.P. energy pistol 10th level, W.P. knife & W.P. energy rifle 8th level; hand to hand basic 10th level', 'Immortal: impervious to S.D.C. weapons, disease, poison, radiation, possession; resists cold/heat/fire; fast bio-regen; resists mind control; must drain P.P.E. from a sentient sacrifice weekly to survive.', 'All spell magic (Rifts RPG and this book); All Necromancer Magic; Excellent understanding of Bio-Wizardry, Bio-Wizard devices and symbiotes; Spell Strength 15', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bio-Wizard symbiotes, weapons and devices; Daemonfist: greatest rune staff, Diabolic alignment IQ18, 1D6x10 M.D./blow, Soul Drinker, wielder''s spells cast 3 levels higher, Summon Demons (1D4/day, 10 min/level), Blood Ritual (sacrifice 4 sentients to summon demons); Skin of the Demon: living Bio-Wizard armor, 300 M.D.C. (regen 4D6 M.D.C./min), half damage from fire/plasma; Soul Bottle: spirit-torture device; Bands of Denial: blocks armor-piercing spells entirely; assorted standard and Techno-Wizard magic items', 'Treasure trove worth 40+ million credits, 10 million Universal credits, plus wealth of his Kingdom and the City of Brass', 'Megalomaniacal and hate-driven; calculating, cruel and sadistic, tempered by a twisted sense of humor.', 'Demons (in general); the Grim Reapers; Lord Splynncryth of Atlantis', 'Prosek family; Coalition States; Lords of Magic; Dweomer City; rival Brotherhoods of magic', 'Immortal, demon-empowered ruler of the True Federation of Magic and the City of Brass; obsessive rival of the Lords of Magic.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.40-41');
  'mestoph-denali', 'Mestoph Denali', 'Bridget Daniels', 'Demonic Advisor; Mestoph the Enforcer, Mestoph the Black', 'rifts', 'Once human, now a Hidden Corrupt; supernatural being', '9th level Corrupt', 9, 'Diabolic', 'Approximately 200 (appears early 30s)', '6 feet, 8 inches (2 m)', '180 pounds (81 kg) of muscle', '{"IQ":12,"ME":17,"MA":12,"PS":36,"PP":23,"PE":20,"PB":13,"Spd":45}', NULL, NULL, 101, 95, NULL, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":8,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":6,"roll":4}', '+2 to save vs magic; impervious to poison, toxins, drugs, disease; resistant to cold, heat, fire (half damage); +6 to save vs Horror Factor; never fatigues; horror factor listed as 15 specifically ''as one of Dunscon''s Advisors''', '[{"name":"Camouflage","pct":60},{"name":"Recognize weapon quality","pct":65},{"name":"Demolitions","pct":84},{"name":"Demolitions disposal","pct":84},{"name":"Escape artist","pct":70},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":64},{"name":"Tracking","pct":85},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":80},{"name":"Palming","pct":60},{"name":"Pick pockets","pct":65},{"name":"Seduction","pct":54},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":62},{"name":"Horsemanship: Exotic","pct":80},{"name":"Language: Demongogian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Basic math","pct":90}]', 'W.P. knife, W.P. blunt, W.P. energy rifle, W.P. heavy energy weapon', 'Standard Corrupt abilities; impervious to poison/toxins/disease, resists elements, never fatigues.', 'Shadow Meld; Levitate; Agony; Blind; Shatter; Mystic Fulcrum; Aura of Power', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laser scalpels; Vibro-Blades; electro-stunners; various CS energy weapons; Black Halberd (favorite): magical polearm, 6D6 M.D., hurled to 1000 ft (305 m), double damage to good-aligned supernatural beings', 'Personal treasure trove of gems/jewelry worth 8+ million credits, plus half a million in universal credits', 'Vengeful, bloodthirsty and sadistic; blames others, especially men, for her misfortunes.', 'Lord Dunscon; other council members; other Corrupt', 'Pretty much everyone else', 'A rare ''Hidden'' Corrupt who retained her human personality; Dunscon''s Enforcer, leading brutal raids and punitive squads.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.43-44');
  'kara-zayne', 'Kara Zayne', NULL, 'Head of the Mystic Triad', 'rifts', NULL, '8th level Lord Magus', 8, 'Scrupulous', '31, but looks 23 - ages one year for every five', '5 feet, 5 inches tall (1.67 m)', '130 lbs. (59 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":17,"MA":15,"PS":14,"PP":23,"PE":23,"PB":14,"Spd":12}', NULL, NULL, 46, 172, 30, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":6,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+4 to save vs mind control; +1 to save vs psionics; +4 to save vs Horror Factor; +2 to save vs illusions; +6 to save vs magic; +4 to save vs poison & disease; critical strike on 19-20; body flip/throw; +5% to save vs coma & death; fatigues at half rate; holds breath 3 min; +5% balance', NULL, 'All skills standard for Lord Magus O.C.C.', 'Standard Lord Magus O.C.C. abilities; fatigues at half rate, holds breath 3 minutes, good balance and coordination.', 'Standard Lord Magus spells; Spell Strength 14', 'Sense evil; Sense magic; See aura; Mind block; Astral projection; Object read; See the invisible', NULL, NULL, 'Magic armor; Battle Fury sword', NULL, 'Idealistic, friendly and self-sacrificing; struggles to keep her humanity and stay connected to ordinary people.', 'Fellow Mystic Triad members; Citizens of Magestar and Dweomer City; the Cyber-Knights', 'The Coalition; Grim Reapers; Necromancers', 'Youngest-ever Lord Magus trainee who left Dweomer City''s isolationism to found Magestar and lead the Mystic Triad.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.54-55');
  'dan-ironforge', 'Dan Ironforge', 'Dannythelgon Ironforge', 'High Magus of the Mystic Triad', 'rifts', 'Dwarf', '6th level High Mage', 6, 'Scrupulous', '44', '3 feet, 10 inches tall (1.17 m)', '170 lbs. (67.5 kg)', '{"IQ":20,"ME":15,"MA":9,"PS":16,"PP":22,"PE":19,"PB":9,"Spd":11}', 39, 38, NULL, 128, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":8,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":2,"roll":3}', 'Critical strike on natural 19-20; +5 to save vs magic; +2 to save vs poison; +3 to save vs mind control; +3 to save vs Horror Factor; fatigues at half rate; holds breath ~3 min; good balance; nightvision 90 ft (27m); +5% on mechanical, military, electrical, computer skills', '[{"name":"Dwarven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Magic Lore","pct":95},{"name":"Demon Lore","pct":75},{"name":"Faerie Lore","pct":65},{"name":"Carpentry","pct":80},{"name":"Basic Mechanics","pct":80}]', 'W.P. Staff, Hand to Hand: Basic', 'Dwarven nightvision 90 ft; +5% mechanical/military/electrical/computer skills; fatigues at half rate; good balance.', 'Standard High Magus spells; Spell Strength 13', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Quite a collection of weapons and equipment (unspecified; prefers to create items rather than carry them)', NULL, 'Good-natured, industrious daydreamer; grumbles about Council duties but secretly enjoys building Magestar.', 'Dweomer City; the Lords of Magic; Cyber-Knights; citizens of Magestar', 'The Coalition; Grim Reapers; Necromancers', 'Dwarven High Mage and master craftsman of magic items; member of the Mystic Triad and Magestar''s Town Council.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.57');
  'kzaa', 'K''zaa', 'Kyarennzaa Distorynn', 'Master of Stormspire', 'rifts', 'Lizard Mage', '14th level Ley Line Walker, 10th level Techno-Wizard', 14, 'Aberrant evil', '374 years', '7 feet (2.1 m) tall', '250 lbs. (112.5 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":20,"MA":15,"PS":21,"PP":22,"PE":14,"PB":6,"Spd":12}', NULL, NULL, 900, 2200, 152, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":8,"parry":8,"dodge":8}', '+4 to save vs magic', '[{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Dwarven","pct":98},{"name":"Wolfen","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Demongogian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Recognize magic items","pct":80},{"name":"Recognize precious metals/stones","pct":80},{"name":"Read mystic symbols","pct":98},{"name":"Recognize enchantment","pct":98},{"name":"Recognize magic circles","pct":98},{"name":"Magic Lore","pct":98},{"name":"Demon Lore","pct":98},{"name":"Faerie Lore","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Keen vision, sharp hearing, warm-blooded.', 'All power words, all wards, all circles of protection; Summoning Circles (elementals, serpents, greater demons); Power Circles: Dimensional Rift, Force, Death, Power, Power Matrix, Teleport; All Ley Line Walker spells levels 1-15', 'All sensitive and physical psionic powers; Deaden pain; Psychic surgery; Psychic diagnosis; Bio-manipulation; Super regeneration; Telemechanics; Electrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Huge trove of magical items, especially Techno-Wizard devices (no fixed favorite)', NULL, 'Amoral but good-humored merchant-wizard; friendly and cheerful so long as things go his way; prefers subtle vengeance over violence.', 'The Federation of Magic (loosely); Denizens of Stormspire; the Grim Reapers; Society of Sages', 'Lord Dunscon and his True Federation of Magic; the Coalition; the Splugorth (business rival)', 'Wealth-obsessed Lizard Mage Techno-Wizard who rules Stormspire, the Megaverse''s leading Techno-Wizard manufacturing city.', 'Rifts World Book 16: Federation of Magic p.61-62');
