  'task-master', 'Task Master', 'John Talbot', NULL, 'heroes-unlimited', 'Special Training', 'Mercenary', 7, 'Diabolic', '46', '5ft 8in', '170lbs', '{"IQ":12,"ME":13,"MA":11,"PS":16,"PP":11,"PE":14,"PB":15,"Spd":16}', 38, 46, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5}', '+15% to skills (Scholastic Bonus)', '[{"name":"Math: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Biology","pct":98},{"name":"Sculpture","pct":95},{"name":"Computer Operation","pct":98},{"name":"Swim: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Explosives (dual roll 80%/70%)","pct":80},{"name":"Investigative","pct":85},{"name":"Escape Artist","pct":88},{"name":"Prowl","pct":85},{"name":"Tracking (dual roll 85%/80%)","pct":85},{"name":"Disguise","pct":65},{"name":"Electronics: Basic","pct":75},{"name":"Pick Pockets","pct":60},{"name":"Pilot: Auto","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot: Airplane","pct":84},{"name":"First Aid","pct":68}]', 'Hand to Hand: Assassin, Athletics, Running, Body Building, W.P. Automatic Pistol, W.P. Rifle', 'No super powers; a trained human mercenary/sniper relying on skill, weapons and physical conditioning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sap Glove (lead lined, +2 to damage); Utility belt; .45 Colt; 9mm P5 Walther Mini-Uzi; 7.62mm G3 sniper rifle (Heckler and Koch); 8 throwing knives; Rifle-launched grenades; Smoke pellets; Night sight goggles (built into riot helmet)', NULL, 'Calm, professional killer who enjoys the hunt and shows no regard for others'' lives; the perfect hired gun.', 'Shadow Master (hired him, working relationship); Power Master (Crime Masters, but slaps him down often)', NULL, 'Handsome, white-haired veteran mercenary and de facto second-in-command of the Crime Masters, hired by Shadow Master; guards a side entrance.', 'Revised Heroes Unlimited p.234-235');
