  'brain-storm', 'Brain Storm', 'Jeff Erickson', NULL, 'heroes-unlimited', 'Natural Psionic', 'Comic Shop Clerk', 2, 'Unprincipled', '18', '5ft 10in', '160lbs', '{"IQ":12,"ME":19,"MA":15,"PS":17,"PP":11,"PE":20,"PB":15,"Spd":12}', 24, 47, NULL, NULL, 62, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":3}', '+12% to skills (Scholastic Bonus)', '[{"name":"Math: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Math: Advanced","pct":72},{"name":"Chemistry","pct":70},{"name":"Chemistry: Analytical","pct":65},{"name":"Swimming: Basic","pct":76},{"name":"Swimming: Advanced","pct":70},{"name":"Fishing","pct":60},{"name":"Pilot: Automobile","pct":88},{"name":"Pilot: Motorcycle","pct":68},{"name":"Pilot: Sailboat","pct":68},{"name":"Pilot: Motorboat","pct":68},{"name":"Navigation","pct":54}]', 'Boxing, Hand to Hand: Basic, Athletics: General, Body Building', 'Newly-manifested natural psionic with telekinesis, hydrokinesis, and bio-regeneration, plus minor psychic senses; untrained in combat use of his powers.', NULL, 'major abilities: Telekinesis, Hydrokinesis, Bio-Regeneration; secondary abilities: See Aura, Sixth Sense, Detect Psionics, Alter Aura, Object Read, Death Trance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Frightened, reluctant college freshman coerced into villainy by blackmail; fights defensively unless cornered.', NULL, 'Gold Falcon (blackmailing him)', '18-year-old University of Las Vegas freshman whose new psionic powers were discovered by Gold Falcon, who blackmails him into staging a fake Hoover Dam threat.', 'Revised Heroes Unlimited p.236-237');
  'gold-falcon', 'Gold Falcon', 'Steve Douglas', NULL, 'heroes-unlimited', 'Experiment (accidental)', 'Seven-Eleventeen night clerk, opportunist', 2, 'Miscreant', '28', '6ft 1in', '190lbs', '{"IQ":10,"ME":9,"MA":14,"PS":14,"PP":15,"PE":8,"PB":13,"Spd":10}', 9, 81, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4}', '+5% to skills (Scholastic Bonus)', '[{"name":"Math: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Programming","pct":75},{"name":"Computer Operation","pct":55},{"name":"Writing: Creative","pct":30},{"name":"Pilot: Automobile","pct":88},{"name":"Pilot: Motorcycle","pct":68},{"name":"Pilot: Truck","pct":68},{"name":"Pick Locks","pct":45},{"name":"Pick Pockets","pct":40}]', 'Acrobatics, Gymnastics, Hand to Hand: Expert, Swimming: Basic, General Athletics, Prowl, W.P. Knife, W.P. Revolver', 'Accidental radiation exposure gave him electrical-field projection, gliding flight, heightened hearing, and enhanced vision.', NULL, NULL, 'Energy Expulsion: Electrical Field; Flight: Glide; Heightened Sense of Hearing; Super Vision: Advanced Sight', NULL, '.45 Colt (plus 36 extra bullets); 2 knives; 4 high explosive grenades; 2 grey smoke grenades; 1 canister of tear gas', NULL, 'Solitary, mean-spirited bully; cocky, overconfident, and willing to betray an accomplice to save himself.', 'Brain Storm/Jeff Erickson (coerced accomplice); unnamed henchmen', 'police', 'Convenience-store clerk turned petty criminal after a leaking store microwave gave him powers; plans an armored-car heist using Jeff Erickson as a diversion.', 'Revised Heroes Unlimited p.237');
  'james-lome', 'James Lome', NULL, 'Prime Minister of Free Quebec', 'rifts', NULL, '10th level Scholar/Politician/Leader', 10, 'Aberrant', '48', '6 feet, 1 inch (1.84 m)', '185 lbs (83 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":17,"MA":26,"PS":15,"PP":17,"PE":20,"PB":15,"Spd":19}', 56, 22, NULL, 14, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":6,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":6,"roll":2,"damage":3}', '+7% to skills, +1 save vs insanity/psionics, 70% to trust/intimidate, +3 save vs Magic, +10% save vs coma/death, critical strike on 18-20', '[{"name":"Literacy: American","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Old French","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Old French","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Techno-Can","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Euro","pct":98},{"name":"Basic Math","pct":98},{"name":"Advanced Math","pct":98},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Operations","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Automobile","pct":95},{"name":"Pilot Hover Craft","pct":98},{"name":"Lore: Demons and Monsters","pct":97},{"name":"Lore: D-Bees and Magic","pct":97},{"name":"Writing","pct":97},{"name":"Anthropology","pct":82},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":75},{"name":"Prowl","pct":77},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":56},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":72},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":67}]', 'Hand to Hand: Expert (10th level); W.P. E-Pistol, W.P. Knife, W.P. E-Rifle (10th level), W.P. Blunt (3rd level)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Amplified hearing and sound filtration; Toxic filter', 'Vibro-Knife (hip-sheath); Wilk''s 320 Laser Pistol; Wilk''s 457 rifle (favorite); T-40 "Plain-Clothes" business suits/tuxedos/coats; QEBA-10 Body Armor (80 M.D.C., field/speeches only)', NULL, 'Demanding, charismatic leader; forgives one failure but never a second; ruthless strategist who hates failure.', NULL, NULL, 'Ten-year Prime Minister of Free Quebec; a war-veteran politician credited with the nation''s military buildup and secession from the Coalition States.', '