  'sylvain-richard', 'Sylvain Richard', 'Sylvain Joseph Richard', 'Radio Personality', 'rifts', NULL, '6th level City Rat', 6, 'Anarchist with delusions of self-importance', '27', '5 feet, 10 inches (1.78 m)', '160 lbs (72 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":12,"MA":24,"PS":13,"PP":19,"PE":11,"PB":17,"Spd":31}', 39, 18, NULL, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"strike":4,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":6}', 'critical strike on natural 18-20; 80% to trust/intimidate; 35% to charm/impress', '[{"name":"Streetwise","pct":60},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":80},{"name":"Pilot Motorcycle","pct":95},{"name":"Pilot Automobile","pct":80},{"name":"Basic Math","pct":80},{"name":"Prowl","pct":70},{"name":"Find Contraband, Weapons and Cybernetics","pct":61},{"name":"Computer Operation","pct":75},{"name":"Writing","pct":60},{"name":"Literacy","pct":65}]', 'Hand to Hand: Martial Arts (6th level); W.P. Knife; W.P. Energy Pistol; Acrobatics; Athletics; Running', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vibro-Knife; C-18 Laser Pistol; Plain-Clothes leather jacket with M.D.C. padding (A.R. 10, M.D.C. 12)', NULL, 'Charismatic, naive true-believer radio celebrity; enjoys debate and adoration, easily led by those he trusts.', 'Julie Tremblay; Prime Minister James Lome', 'Coalition States / Emperor Prosek (on CS most-wanted list)', 'Third-generation radio celebrity and C.F.Q.C. part-owner, unwittingly used by PM Lome as a propaganda mouthpiece against the Coalition.', 'Rifts World Book 22: Free Quebec p.145');
  'julie-tremblay', 'Julie Tremblay', 'Julie Marie Tremblay', 'Official Radio Correspondent (Captain)', 'rifts', NULL, '6th level CS Military Specialist', 6, 'Scrupulous', '25', '5 feet, 10 inches (1.78 m)', '150 lbs, all muscle (67.5 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":17,"MA":24,"PS":15,"PP":19,"PE":12,"PB":15,"Spd":14}', 39, 18, NULL, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":6,"strike":4,"parry":7,"dodge":9,"roll":2}', 'pin/incapacitate on natural 18-20; critical strike on natural 18-20; 80% to trust/intimidate', '[{"name":"Radio Basic","pct":80},{"name":"Literacy","pct":65},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Operations","pct":85},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":62},{"name":"Pilot Hover Craft","pct":85},{"name":"Pilot Robots and Power Armor","pct":71},{"name":"Read Sensory Instruments","pct":70},{"name":"Pick Locks","pct":65},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":65},{"name":"Escape Artist","pct":65},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":65},{"name":"Parachuting","pct":85},{"name":"Military Etiquette","pct":80},{"name":"Play Musical Instrument (clarinet)","pct":70}]', 'Hand to Hand: Expert (5th level); Robot Combat: Elite (SAMAS); Boxing; Wrestling; W.P. Energy Pistol; W.P. Energy Rifle; W.P. Knife', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Amplified hearing and sound filtration system; Toxic filter; Artificial spleen (bio-system replacement, accidental injury)', 'Vibro-Knife (worn at all times); C-18 Laser Pistol; C-12 Laser Rifle; "Plain Clothes" Armor (28 M.D.C.); Standard Military body armor (80 M.D.C.)', NULL, 'Confident, disciplined career officer and perfectionist; mildly resents the attention Sylvain Richard receives.', 'Sylvain Richard; Prime Minister James Lome', 'Coalition propaganda machine (branded her a traitor)', 'National Assembly''s official radio correspondent and a CS Military Specialist Captain, appointed to steer Sylvain Richard''s broadcasts.', 'Rifts World Book 22: Free Quebec p.146-147');
  'jean-desjardins', 'Jean Desjardins', NULL, '"Franko" - Lunatic Visionary', 'rifts', NULL, '9th level Wilderness Scout', 9, 'Miscreant', '37', '6 feet (1.8 m)', '175 lbs (78.75 kg)', '{"IQ":16,"ME":20,"MA":21,"PS":14,"PP":18,"PE":16,"PB":12,"Spd":19}', 52, 54, NULL, 7, NULL, NULL, 10, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":4,"parry":9,"dodge":10,"roll":4}', 'Horror/Awe Factor 15 to those in his organization; critical strike on 18-20; +3 save vs psionic attack; 65% to trust/intimidate; mild schizophrenic (paranoia, delusions, obsession)', '[{"name":"Cooking","pct":80},{"name":"Climbing","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Techno-Can","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Inuit","pct":98},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":88},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":92},{"name":"Identify Plants","pct":85},{"name":"Fishing","pct":90},{"name":"Prowl","pct":85},{"name":"Track Animals","pct":80},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":90},{"name":"Pilot Hover Vehicle","pct":90},{"name":"Disguise","pct":75}]', 'Climbing also 90% rappel ("98%/90%"); Hand to Hand: Expert (9th level); Boxing; Sniper; W.P. Knife, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol (all 9th level)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Amplified hearing and sound filtration (bionic); Gyro-compass and clock calendar (bionic)', 'L-20 laser pulse rifle; Wilk''s 320 Laser Pistol; Vibro-Knife (1D6 M.D.); Survival knife; NG-S2 survival pack; Infrared distancing binoculars; Thermo-imaging rifle scope; 2 smoke grenades; 2 fragmentation grenades; Huntsman body armor (60 M.D.C.)', '1000 credits; 12,000 credits worth of Black Market equipment/supplies on his person for trade', 'Passionate but secretive extremist; hides his identity, prefers whispering through chosen speakers to addressing crowds directly.', '"Colonel" Robert Miller (originally inspired him, no recent contact); six deranged personal followers', 'Free Quebec authorities; Coalition troops; D-Bees', 'Schizophrenic, messianic extremist behind les Soldats de St. Jean''s most violent wing; his true appearance is unknown to any authority.', 'Rifts World Book 22: Free Quebec p.150');
  'robert-miller', 'Robert Miller', NULL, '"Colonel" - les Soldats de St. Jean Chapter Colonel', 'rifts', NULL, '7th level Wilderness Scout and something of a Rogue Scholar', 7, 'Scrupulous (albeit a bit deluded)', '41', '6 feet, 2 inches (1.88 m)', '175 lbs (78.75 kg)', '{"IQ":15,"ME":18,"MA":21,"PS":14,"PP":15,"PE":17,"PB":11,"Spd":14}', 52, 54, NULL, 9, NULL, NULL, 8, '{"attacks":6,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"roll":2}', 'Horror/Awe Factor 12 to his followers, none to "Franko"; +2 save vs psionic attacks; 65% to trust/intimidate; +5% save vs coma/death; +1 save vs magic; critical on 18-20', '[{"name":"Literacy","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Old French","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Inuit","pct":98},{"name":"Basic Math","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Operations","pct":70},{"name":"Pilot Automobile","pct":90},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":80},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":82}]', 'Hand to Hand: Expert (7th level); Boxing; W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Bolt-Action Rifle, W.P. Knife (all 7th level); Climbing; Hunting; Fishing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Wilk''s 457 energy rifle; F-18 laser pistol; NG-S2 survival pack; 2 Vibro-Knives; full wilderness gear; Huntsman body armor; repainted captured Dead Boy armor (for combat)', 'Access to over 500,000 credits worth of equipment, money and stores (not counting items stolen from the CS)', 'Quiet, thoughtful, benevolent leader and tactician; tolerates dissent, prefers driving off D-Bees rather than slaughtering them.', '"Franko"/Jean Desjardins (originally inspired him, no direct contact in years); his brigade of armed civilians and support personnel', 'Coalition States (raids/robs CS troops near the border)', 'Influential southwestern Free Quebec chapter leader of les Soldats de St. Jean, commanding nearly a brigade of guerrillas against the CS.', 'Rifts World Book 22: Free Quebec p.151-152');
  'robert-carlye', 'Robert Carlye', 'Robert Williams Carlye', 'Professor, leader of the COF (Children of Freedom)', 'rifts', NULL, '10th level Scholar and Terrorist Leader', 10, 'Miscreant', '51', '6 feet, 2 inches (1.86 m)', '285 lbs (128 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":8,"MA":20,"PS":14,"PP":9,"PE":10,"PB":9,"Spd":9}', 46, 22, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"roll":2}', '60% to evoke trust/intimidate; Hand to Hand: Basic, but only at 3rd level', '[{"name":"Literacy: American","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Euro","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Old French","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Old French","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Euro","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Inuit","pct":98},{"name":"Basic Math","pct":98},{"name":"Advanced Math","pct":98},{"name":"Anthropology","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Operations","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Programming","pct":98},{"name":"History","pct":98},{"name":"Law","pct":98},{"name":"Writing","pct":98},{"name":"Swim","pct":98},{"name":"Fish","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Sail Boat","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Hover Craft","pct":98},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":90},{"name":"TV/Video","pct":87},{"name":"Computer Hacking","pct":67},{"name":"Dance","pct":67},{"name":"Sing","pct":92},{"name":"Art","pct":77},{"name":"Forgery","pct":72}]', 'Hand to Hand: Basic (3rd level only); W.P. Energy Pistol (10th level); W.P. Blunt (3rd level)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Weighted walking stick (M.D.C. material, for show); Q1-01 Laser Pistol; Pocket knife; T-40 "Plain-Clothes" business suits and robe (25 M.D.C. each); Specially made non-environmental armor with helmet (50 M.D.C.)', NULL, 'Fire-and-brimstone visionary preacher-scholar; utterly convinced he''s right, disorganized tactically, indifferent to followers'' suffering.', 'Capt. Jeunet and other Children of Freedom henchmen', 'Coalition States; Quebec Military and Government', 'Bald, imposing scholar leading the Children of Freedom terrorist militia, staging attacks on both CS and Quebec forces to further his own vision.', 'Rifts World Book 22: Free Quebec p.175');
  'gwen-severson', 'Gwen Severson', NULL, 'Mayor', 'rifts', 'Human', 'master politician', 9, 'Anarchist with leanings toward unprincipled; often does the right thing even when tempted otherwise, but not always', '45', '5 feet, 10 inches (1.75 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":18,"ME":15,"MA":24,"PS":12,"PP":15,"PE":26,"PB":24,"Spd":14}', 43, 35, 78, 7, 85, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"roll":3,"damage":2}', 'P.E. considered supernatural; MDC 78 is a side effect of daily use of the Chichen Itza healing well water (reverts to SDC 35 if supply stops); critical strike 19-20', NULL, NULL, 'Heals rapidly from constant use of Chichen Itza''s healing well water; regenerates 4D6 MDC/minute; the water also grants MDC-creature status and slows aging.', NULL, 'Sixth sense; Total recall; Object read; See aura; Mind block; Empathy; Telepathy; Presence sense', NULL, NULL, 'Silver cross (worn, non-religious); Small silver dagger; Six-shooter with silver bullets', NULL, 'Charming master politician skilled at deflecting hard questions; not a fighter, relies on bodyguards; secretly allied with vampires.', 'The Lost (vampire group); Town of Silvereno; 1st Cavalry (certain high-ranking members)', NULL, 'Mayor of Silvereno for 12 years; secretly a mega-damage being sustained by the healing well of Chichen Itza, in a secret protective pact with a vampire group.', 'Rifts World Book 14: New West p.45-46');
  'jacob-whispering-wind', 'Jacob Whispering Wind', NULL, 'Sheriff', 'rifts', 'Human/Indian', 'Arapaho Spirit Warrior', 7, 'Principled', NULL, '5 feet, 6 inches', NULL, '{"IQ":15,"ME":21,"MA":19,"PS":24,"PP":22,"PE":17,"PB":14,"Spd":24}', 39, 49, NULL, 125, 66, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":6,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":3,"roll":3,"damage":9}', 'Hand to hand: expert; critical strike 18-20; kick attacks 1D6+9 damage or 2D4+9 S.D.C. from auto-kick', '[{"name":"Read and write","pct":60},{"name":"Math","pct":80},{"name":"Identify plants & fruits","pct":65},{"name":"Fish","pct":80},{"name":"Cook","pct":75},{"name":"Radio: basic","pct":70},{"name":"Track (humanoids)","pct":70},{"name":"Track animals","pct":70},{"name":"Land navigation","pct":75},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":70}]', 'Hunting (no % printed), W.P. archery, W.P. blunt (war club), W.P. energy pistol, W.P. energy rifle (all 7th level)', 'Arapaho eagle-totem spirit warrior: flies as the eagle, speaks with birds, superior vision/tracking, bonus SDC and attacks, and a vengeance cry that penalizes marked foes.', 'Fly as the eagle (5 PPE); Speak with birds (10 PPE); Spirit of the Eagle (10 PPE: +50 SDC, +1 combat action, +1 attack, +10 SDC h2h damage); Eyes of the Eagle (8 PPE: 2-mile vision, tracking 75%); Eagle''s Cry (25 PPE: marks target, -4 initiative/-2 bonuses/-2 attacks vs accuser until vengeance served)', 'Clairvoyance; Sixth sense', NULL, NULL, 'Wilk''s-Remi laser rifle; CFT 1886er; Neural mace; Pocket knife; Apache war club; Magical Apache war necklace/amulet (100 MDC, regenerates 1D4x10 MDC/hr, only he can wear it); Magical eagle''s talon', NULL, 'Stern, intelligent, alert Apache lawman; courageous, resourceful, unwavering in duty; distrusts the Mayor''s evasiveness.', 'Silvereno townspeople; His deputies; Various Indian and wilderness friends', NULL, 'Apache warrior turned town sheriff of Silvereno for two years; highly respected for fairness and courage; suspects (but hasn''t proven) vampires operate in the area.', 'Rifts World Book 14: New West p.48-49');
  'essai-ramirez', 'Essai Ramirez', NULL, 'The Vampire Lord', 'rifts', 'Master Vampire', 'Master Vampire', 8, 'Aberrant', NULL, '5 feet, 9 inches', '140 lbs (63 kg)', '{"IQ":18,"ME":20,"MA":26,"PS":36,"PP":25,"PE":23,"PB":20,"Spd":32}', NULL, NULL, 200, 40, 165, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":3,"strike":9,"parry":12,"dodge":12,"roll":6}', 'All attributes considered supernatural; printed as single combined ''M.D.C./Hit Points: 200'' value (no separate SDC); inflicts M.D. from punches/kicks (supernatural PS); critical strike 18-20', '[{"name":"Land navigation","pct":65},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":70}]', 'W.P. energy pistol, W.P. energy rifle, W.P. knife (all 8th level)', 'Master vampire: impervious except to wood, silver, holy water, sunlight, magic; shapeshifts to bat/wolf/mist; regenerates 2D6 HP/melee; smells blood 1 mile; summons rodents, canines, fog.', NULL, 'Mind control; Link with minions; Death trance; Alter aura; Empathy; Mind block; Presence sense; Sense evil; Deaden pain; Induce sleep; Hypnotic suggestion; Super hypnotic suggestion', NULL, NULL, '50 M.D.C. breast plate; NG-P7 Particle beam rifle; TX 500 rail gun; Ring of Agony (casts agony 4x/day, +4 spell strength, equal to 6th-level spell, save 16+); Necklace of Speed of the Snail (casts 4x/day at 6th level, +4 spell strength); Vials of Chichen Itza healing well water', NULL, 'Calm, cold, and calculating; regards mortals as pawns, playthings, and food, but follows his own code of ethics.', 'The Lost (vampire group he leads); Mayor Gwen Severson', NULL, 'Ancient master vampire secretly leading the vampire group ''The Lost'' in Silvereno on behalf of a vampire intelligence in Chichen Itza; poses as Katherine''s mysterious gambler lover.', 'Rifts World Book 14: New West p.51');
  'katherine-delgado', 'Katherine Delgado', NULL, 'The Vampire Queen', 'rifts', 'Secondary Vampire', 'Secondary Vampire', 6, 'Miscreant', NULL, '5 feet, 8 inches (1.72 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":16,"ME":18,"MA":22,"PS":26,"PP":22,"PE":25,"PB":26,"Spd":21}', NULL, NULL, 110, 30, 120, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":6,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"roll":5}', 'All attributes considered supernatural; printed as single combined ''M.D.C./Hit Points: 110'' value (no separate SDC); supernatural PS does mega-damage; critical strike on natural 20', NULL, NULL, 'Secondary vampire: impervious except to wood, silver, holy water, sunlight, magic; shapeshifts to bat/wolf/mist; regenerates 2D6 HP/melee; summons rodents, canines, fog; keen senses.', NULL, 'Mind control; Link with minions; Death trance; Alter aura; Empathy; Mind block; Presence sense; Sense evil; Deaden pain; Induce sleep; Hypnotic suggestion; Super hypnotic suggestion', NULL, NULL, 'Ancient blades / Vibro-Blades and other hand weapons; Remi-Derringer energy pistol; Rings and gem-studded necklaces (~150,000 credits); Magical Indian war spear (5D6 S.D.C. to humans, 5D6 M.D. to supernatural creatures/M.D.C. structures, double damage to vampires; thrown 500 ft with 4 PPE or 8 ISP)', NULL, 'Cruel and possessive; sees humans as prey; obsessively devoted to Essai and prone to violent jealous rages.', 'Essai Ramirez (true love); The vampire intelligence of Chichen Itza', NULL, 'Secondary vampire and Essai''s devoted lover; owns and runs the Lucky Lady saloon/brothel in Silvereno, using it to pick out victims for the vampires.', 'Rifts World Book 14: New West p.51-52');
  'thadius-geller', 'Thadius Geller', NULL, 'Doctor', 'rifts', 'Human', 'Trader', 10, 'Unprincipled (with tendencies toward scrupulous good)', 'mid to late 40''s', '5 feet, 11 inches (1.8 m)', '230 lbs (104 kg)', '{"IQ":13,"ME":12,"MA":15,"PS":10,"PP":11,"PE":13,"PB":11,"Spd":5}', 46, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":6,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":4,"roll":4,"damage":2}', 'Hand to hand: basic; critical strike 19-20; judo-style body throw/flip (no damage dice printed); recovering alcoholic', '[{"name":"Literacy: American and Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot: Automobile","pct":98},{"name":"Mathematics: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Mathematics: Advanced","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Operation","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Programming","pct":98},{"name":"Play Trombone","pct":85},{"name":"Dance","pct":75},{"name":"Horsemanship: General","pct":76},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":66},{"name":"Lore: Demons/Monsters","pct":70},{"name":"Writing","pct":80},{"name":"First Aid","pct":90}]', 'Speaks American and Spanish (language, no % printed), W.P. Energy Pistol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NGR-G10 Soldier armor (worn only if desperate); Triax TX-43 Laser rifle (2D6 S.D.C. / 2D6 M.D. / 4D6 M.D. settings, 2000 ft/610m range)', 'Bulk of money tied up in the Carnival; keeps an emergency petty-cash fund of roughly 40,000-60,000 credits', 'Good-hearted flimflam man and small-time con artist who genuinely believes his carnival improves people''s lives.', 'Byaltur (carnival security chief, usually escorts/guards Geller)', NULL, 'Self-styled ''Doctor'' and impresario running Doctor Geller''s Carnival of Wonders, a travelling show in the Pecos Empire; not much of a fighter, more a promoter and businessman.', 'Rifts World Book 14: New West p.68');
  'roderick-warrington-iii', 'Roderick Warrington III', NULL, 'The Remarkable Roddy (also formerly the supervillain "Lightning Rod")', 'rifts', 'Human D-Bee from an Earth-like planet without Rifts', 'D-Bee Supervillain', 8, 'Miscreant', 'mid to late 30''s', '5 feet, 6 inches (1.6 m)', '145 lbs (66 kg)', '{"IQ":10,"ME":10,"MA":9,"PS":8,"PP":9,"PE":11,"PB":9,"Spd":11}', 40, 70, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":3,"roll":3,"damage":2}', 'Hand to hand: Martial Arts; +1 extra attack if flying; leap attack and entangle abilities (no numeric bonus printed); critical strike 18-20; jump kick and judo-style body throw/flip (no dice printed); unusual physical trait: all head/facial hair permanently fallen out (wears a toupee)', '[{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: American","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot: Automobile","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot: Race Car","pct":90},{"name":"Pilot: Motorcycle","pct":88},{"name":"Pilot: Motorboat","pct":88},{"name":"Mathematics: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Mathematics: Advanced","pct":92},{"name":"Computer Operation","pct":98},{"name":"Computer Programming","pct":98},{"name":"Photography","pct":85},{"name":"First Aid","pct":85},{"name":"Dance","pct":82},{"name":"Sing","pct":75},{"name":"Write","pct":62}]', 'Acrobatics (3rd level)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chameleon (Major: 95% prowl, blend into environment up to 90%, hold breath 10 min, feign death, adhere to sheer surfaces); Energy Expulsion: Electricity (Minor); Manipulate Kinetic Energy (Minor: kinetic attacks vs. him only half damage, mental parry of one kinetic attack at +4, can redirect thrown objects); Wingless Flight (Minor: 340 mph/546 km; while flying +2 strike, +2 parry, +4 dodge under 80 mph, +6 dodge at 90+ mph, +4 S.D.C. damage per 20 mph)', NULL, 'Maverick body armor (emergency use only); Particle beam rifle (emergency use only)', '2D4x10,000 credits cash on hand, plus 4D4x1,000 credits in other items; ~100,000 