  'arthur-night', 'Arthur Night', NULL, 'Leader of the Grim Reaper Cult', 'rifts', 'Elf', 'Necromancer', 15, 'Diabolic and insane', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"IQ":19,"ME":11,"MA":19,"PS":13,"PP":11,"PE":17,"PB":14,"Spd":16}', 71, 21, NULL, 192, NULL, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":5,"strike":2,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"roll":2,"damage":3}', 'Attacks per melee: 5 physical, or 2 by magic; 60% trust/intimidate; critical strike on 18-20; knock out/stun on unmodified 18-20; critical strike from behind = triple damage; death blow on natural 20; +40 M.D.C. if wearing skull of an ancient demon; Death Vessel grants +10 to save vs psionic attacks and immunity to possession/mind control', '[{"name":"Demon and Monster Lore","pct":98},{"name":"Holistic Medicine","pct":98},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":98}]', 'Hand to Hand: Basic (15th level); W.P. energy rifle, energy pistol, knife', 'Unites with the dead (attaches dead limbs/parts to himself); animates/controls up to 60 dead; vampires can neither mind-control him nor slay him with their bite; unusually slowed aging', 'All necromantic spells; All common spell magic, levels 1-13 (non-death spells cost double P.P.E.)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vibro-Knife; Laser Pistol (1D6 M.D.); Bracelet of Protection (grants 300 M.D.C. for up to 4 hrs, 4x/day); Ring of the Elements (cast any warlock spell at 6th level, free P.P.E., 4x/day); Death Vessel (amulet, +1,000 P.P.E. reservoir, regenerates 50 P.P.E./hr, protects vs possession/mind control); Huntsman Armor (40 M.D.C.); Skull of an ancient demon (+40 M.D.C. when worn)', '~150 million credits, via the cult', 'Utterly insane servant of Death; hides his cult activities behind the harmless public persona of herbalist "Aramis Knight."', 'Alana Black (9th level Necromancer); Otto Schroder (12th level Shifter); Memtar the Destroyer (8th level witch of the Death entity); Overlord Wycleen (renegade Splugorth High Lord); Grim Reaper cult (~500 members, ~1,000 pawns incl. several hundred Juicers)', NULL, 'Elven necromancer, secretly ruler of the Grim Reaper death-cult headquartered beneath Laramy, publicly posing as a kind herbalist.', 'Rifts World Book 10: Juicer Uprising p.97-98');
  'knight-hunter', 'Knight Hunter', 'Ralph Miller', 'Murder-Wraith', 'rifts', 'Undead (Murder-Wraith; formerly human)', 'Juicer Murder-Wraith', 5, 'Diabolic', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"IQ":8,"ME":6,"MA":4,"PS":36,"PP":23,"PE":24,"PB":3,"Spd":63}', 61, 329, NULL, 48, NULL, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":6,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":8,"pull":8}', '+8 to save vs magic, +3 to save vs psionics, +10 to save vs horror factor; damage is per supernatural P.S. (no numeric bonus printed); M.D.C. by armor only (usually wears none) and impervious to normal weapons and M.D. weapons as an undead', '[{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":60},{"name":"Prowl","pct":65},{"name":"detect ambush","pct":60}]', 'Hand to Hand: assassin and boxing; several W.P.''s (unspecified)', 'Full type abilities are in the generic Murder-Wraith entry, cross-referenced not reprinted here; undead, supernatural strength, resists normal/M.D. weapons', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No personal use for it, but has amassed 50,000 credits'' worth of items, which Aramis lets him keep', 'A conniving, self-pitying loser even in undeath; guilt-ridden over murdering his brother Armand, secretly resentful but too afraid to turn on his master Aramis.', 'None, other than the Grim Reapers (serves Aramis Night)', 'Cyber-Knights (attacks any on sight); Armand Miller (his brother, whom he murdered)', 'Undead Murder-Wraith, formerly the Juicer Ralph Miller; jealous of his Cyber-Knight brother, he was made undead by the Grim Reapers and now hunts Cyber-Knights for his master Aramis Night.', 'Rifts World Book 10: Juicer Uprising p.98-99');
  'knife-master', 'Knife Master', 'Arno the Freelancer', 'Leader of the Society of the Knife', 'rifts', 'Wormwood native (appears human)', 'Freelancer (former), now Witch', 8, 'Diabolic', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"IQ":13,"ME":11,"MA":18,"PS":35,"PP":27,"PE":20,"PB":9,"Spd":24}', NULL, NULL, 248, 18, NULL, NULL, 8, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":8,"parry":12,"dodge":12,"roll":7,"pull":7}', 'Horror Factor only applies if his true nature is discovered; +5 to save vs magic, +3 to save vs poison and disease, +6 to save vs horror factor; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C. per hour', '[{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Trade Three","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Trade Four","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Trade Six","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Demongogian","pct":80},{"name":"Demon and Monster Lore","pct":75},{"name":"Prowl","pct":70},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":57}]', 'W.P. knife, W.P. sword; Hand to Hand: Assassin (8th level) plus boxing', 'Gift of Power: enhanced physique and supernatural strength; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C./hour; natural M.D.C. being as a Wormwood native', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Magical Knife (3D6 M.D., returns when thrown); NE-4 plasma cartridge pistol; Wormwood chain mail (40 M.D.C.); Naruni Force Field (110 M.D.C.)', 'Millions, perhaps billions, of credits at his disposal', 'Ruthless, embittered pact-bound leader who vents frustration on others; efficient businessman with no tolerance for disobedience.', 'Trader Smythers / Naruni Enterprises (illegal-weapons arrangement); An unnamed alien intelligence on Level Ten (his true patron); Supernatural creatures on Levels Nine and Ten', NULL, 'A Wormwood-native freelancer-turned-witch who secretly is the masked Knife Master, leader of Center''s criminal Society of the Knife, bound in servitude to a hidden alien intelligence.', 'Rifts Dimension Book 2: Phase World p.23-24');


